WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
BUILD 024. MORE DATA IS NOT MORE INTELLIGENCE. Every collected field creates exposure, retention work, access pathways, and eventual deletion duties.

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
START WITH PURPOSE. START WITH PURPOSE. Name the decision each field supports. Permission does not make unnecessary collection necessary.

3
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
TEST EVERY FIELD. TEST EVERY FIELD. NECESSARY · OPTIONAL · SENSITIVE · DERIVED · PROHIBITED — keep the reason and evidence visible.

4
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
MINIMIZE. MINIMIZE BEFORE COLLECTION. Remove prohibited fields. Default optional fields off. Replace sensitive detail with the least revealing form.

5
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.000
DESIGN THE EXIT. DESIGN THE EXIT. Assign retention, deletion, redaction, and downstream handling before the data enters the workflow.

6
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.000
SAVE THIS. THE SAFEST DATA HAS NO BREACH PATH. THE BEST DATA RISK IS DATA NEVER COLLECTED.

